    "title": "Delaware County Courthouse Prepping for Construction Project - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Janelle Tucker ,\n8 hours ago Construction is ready to get underway on the Delaware County Courthouse project. Due to the onset of construction, the southeast parking lot of the Delaware County Courthouse will be closed to the public – it closed at 5:30 pm Tuesday and will remain closed for the duration of construction. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
